* Common-emitter BJT amplifier with emitter bypass capacitor
.title Common-emitter amplifier
Vcc  vcc 0   DC 12
Vin  src 0   DC 0 AC 1 SIN(0 10m 1k)
Rs   src in  1k
Cin  in  b   10u
RB1  vcc b   47k
RB2  b   0   10k
RC   vcc c   2.2k
RE   e   0   1k
CE   e   0   100u
Cout c   out 10u
RL   out 0   10k
Q1   c b e NPN is=1e-14 bf=150 vaf=100 cje=20p cjc=5p
.op
.ac dec 20 1 10meg
.tran 2u 5m start=3m init=op
.plot V(out) V(src)
.measure pp V(out)
.measure thd V(out) 1k 2
.end
